| List row entity thumb (44px, click preview) | `@/components/patterns` → **ListRowThumbnail**; pass via `GridListRow` **`thumbnail`** prop — resolve with `resolveListRowThumbnail` / `resolveSpeciesListRowThumbnail` from `@/lib/list-row-image.ts` (see `guide/03-entity-card-art.md`) |
